{"text": "To solve this problem, we need to use each of the numbers [2, 8, 10, 12] exactly once along with the operations +, -, *, / to get the target number 24.", "start": 11, "end": 162, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try to break it down step-by-step:", "start": 164, "end": 204, "label": "inform"}
