{"text": "- Multiplication and division can combine to form the target value more easily.", "start": 271, "end": 350, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "- Addition and subtraction can be used to adjust the result closer to 24.", "start": 351, "end": 424, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. A useful approach is to prioritize multiplication and use the remaining operations to fine-tune the result.", "start": 426, "end": 536, "label": "inform"}
