{"text": "This seems too high.", "start": 1660, "end": 1680, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "The correct solution should be:", "start": 1681, "end": 1712, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(12 × (8 - 10/5))", "start": 1714, "end": 1731, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Step-by-step breakdown:", "start": 1733, "end": 1756, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "10 / 5 = 2", "start": 1757, "end": 1767, "label": "inform"}
