{"text": "Final correct solution:", "start": 1795, "end": 1818, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(12 × (8 - 2)) / 1 = 24", "start": 1819, "end": 1842, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "So, the correct breakdown is:", "start": 1844, "end": 1873, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(12 × (8 - 10/5))", "start": 1875, "end": 1892, "label": "inform"}
